MD dynamics of a spring-mass chain with recursion times calculation

```gnuplot
p 'recurs1.dat' u 0:($1/1000) w points pt 7 ps 1 t 'E_1=11.74 meV', 'recurs2.dat' u 0:($1/1000) w points pt 7 ps 1 t 'E_2=11.95 meV'
```

```gnuplot
a = 1.0
b = 1.0

fit a*x 'recurs1.dat' u 0:($1/1000) via a
fit b*x 'recurs2.dat' u 0:($1/1000) via b

p 'recurs1.dat' u 0:($1/1000) w points pt 7 ps 1 t 'E_1=11.74 meV', 'recurs2.dat' u 0:($1/1000) w points pt 7 ps 1 t 'E_2=11.95 meV', a*x w l t 'Fit: 0.842 x', b*x w l t 'Fit: 0.992 x'
```

$b = 0.99221 $ , $a = 0.842718$ , $E_1 = 11.740818 meV$ , $E_2 = = 11.947426 meV$

### Results
Note that results are fitted onto a [ns] time-scale.
Therefore
